00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:48.760 line:100%
LUMINOL

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:52.600 line:100%
The restroom is… It's behind you.

00:01:56.960 --> 00:01:57.800 line:100%
Thanks.

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:24.320 line:100%
HARD-BOILED

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.840 line:100%
STRONG BLEACHING POWDER

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:31.080 line:100%
Alright.

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:37.920 line:100%
After Captain Ran passed away,
I went to his house to pack up his things.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:40.680 line:100%
In the study,
I found this woodworking box.

00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:48.160 line:100%
I've never opened this box.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.000 line:100%
After bringing it back,

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:53.920 line:100%
it's been sealed until now.

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:13.600 line:100%
OCTAGONAL LAMPSHADE

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:25.680 line:100%
XU MENG AND DAUGHTER

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:33.120 line:100%
DRAFT SAVED SUCCESSFULLY

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:35.520 line:100%
HE YUANHANG

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:36.960 line:20%
REPORTERS: RAN FANGXU, HE YUANHANG

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:42.280 line:100%
The names are in the wrong order.

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:45.640 line:100%
-There's no need for that.
-He, listen to me.

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:46.680 line:100%
Professionally,

00:07:46.760 --> 00:07:49.600 line:100%
the main credit for solving
this case belongs to you.

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:52.120 line:100%
And personally, you still have a career
ahead in the criminal department.

00:07:52.640 --> 00:07:54.320 line:100%
I'm about to transfer back to the station.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:55.400 line:100%
-Whose name comes first
-Sir…

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:57.000 line:100%
-doesn't matter.
-Sir.

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:19.960 line:100%
APPLICATION FOR CRIMINAL DETENTION

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:29.640 line:100%
On Chinese New Year's Eve,
do you have any plans?

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:32.280 line:100%
Sir's exact words were,

00:08:32.839 --> 00:08:35.800 line:100%
"As a family, let's have
a reunion dinner together."

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:44.560 line:20%
APPLICATION FOR CRIMINAL DETENTION

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:57.800 line:100%
XINGWANG RESTAURANT
YUEDE CITY, GUIZHOU PROVINCE

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:11.120 line:100%
-Hello? Xingwang Restaurant.
-Hello.

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:13.680 line:100%
I'm an officer from the Nanshan Branch
of the Weiyang Public Security Bureau.

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:16.520 line:100%
<i>I'm looking for Qiao Suqing's aunt.</i>

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:18.640 line:100%
The police?

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:22.240 line:100%
What… What has Qiao Suqing done now?

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:24.520 line:100%
<i>I haven't heard from her</i>
<i>in five or six years.</i>

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:29.400 line:100%
After Qiao Suqing's mother passed away,
you were once her guardian, right?

00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:30.360 line:100%
Officer,

00:09:32.520 --> 00:09:33.800 line:100%
I didn't sell Qing.

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:36.360 line:100%
<i>I… Let me tell you,</i>

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:39.280 line:100%
<i>the Yao family was very well-off.</i>

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:42.200 line:100%
We were only thinking
of finding her a place to stay.

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:44.440 line:100%
It was to find her a way out.

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:48.760 line:100%
<i>You have no idea, Officer.</i>
<i>If I hadn't sent Qing away early,</i>

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:51.320 line:100%
<i>she probably would have</i>
<i>been ruined by her uncle long ago.</i>

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.560 line:100%
<i>I really did it for her own good.</i>

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:56.680 line:100%
Officer,

00:09:57.280 --> 00:09:59.080 line:100%
let me tell you.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:03.240 line:100%
This business about finding
Qing a place to go wasn't my idea.

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:06.480 line:100%
<i>That year, when she</i>
<i>and her mom went to… Mount Wu.</i>

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:09.040 line:100%
<i>While they were on a trip there,</i>
<i>her mom told me herself.</i>

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:11.120 line:100%
<i>Her mom took her there for a blind date.</i>

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:12.720 line:100%
<i>Don't you see?</i>

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:15.360 line:100%
<i>If even her own mother</i>
<i>couldn't wait to sell her off,</i>

00:10:15.440 --> 00:10:18.960 line:100%
<i>as her aunt, why couldn't I?</i>

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:53.760 line:100%
CONTACTS: QIAO

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.040 line:100%
Qiao Suqing.

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:11.200 line:100%
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH: RELEASE FORM

00:11:11.280 --> 00:11:13.200 line:100%
QIAO SUQING
PROPERTY DETAILS: BAG, MOBILE PHONE

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:16.480 line:100%
SIGNATURE: QIAO SUQING

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:24.600 line:100%
Thanks.

00:11:31.320 --> 00:11:32.360 line:20%
WEIYANG PUBLIC
SECURITY BUREAU NANSHAN BRANCH

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:40.040 line:100%
FAIR AND JUST, LOYAL AND TRUE

00:11:52.720 --> 00:11:54.960 line:100%
Qiao Suqing, you are suspected
of intentional homicide.

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:55.720 line:100%
DETENTION WARRANT

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:57.720 line:100%
Pursuant to the Criminal Procedure Law
of the PRC,

00:11:57.800 --> 00:12:00.440 line:100%
Article 80, you are hereby
placed under criminal detention.

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:09.040 line:100%
Don't worry.

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:11.720 line:100%
Go on.

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:17.360 line:100%
I'm listening.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:47.720 line:100%
Speak up.

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:51.040 line:100%
How did you kill Xu Meng and her father?

00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:55.760 line:100%
Officer He,

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:59.080 line:100%
I've already answered this question.

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:03.640 line:100%
Wu Shanlong killed Xu Meng and her father.
It had nothing to do with me.

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:06.840 line:100%
No matter how many times
you handcuff me and bring me in,

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:09.080 line:100%
or how many times you ask,

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:11.240 line:100%
the answer remains the same.

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:15.720 line:100%
Tell me,

00:14:16.640 --> 00:14:18.400 line:100%
who is the person in this elevator?

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:26.120 line:100%
-Aren't they Xu Meng and her father?
-Are they?

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.240 line:100%
This photo

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:32.520 line:100%
was left behind by Uncle Ran.

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:36.720 line:100%
He also drew this circle.

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:39.600 line:100%
Tell me, why did he do that?

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:43.160 line:100%
I don't know.

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:11.400 line:100%
Because the person on her back
isn't Xu Zhihong at all.

00:15:14.920 --> 00:15:15.840 line:100%
It's you.

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:26.000 line:100%
<i>Yuanlongli</i>

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:28.800 line:100%
<i>Eighteenth floor</i>

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:34.160 line:100%
<i>Eighteenth floor with 18 pillars</i>

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:39.960 line:100%
<i>Eighteen pillars with 18 men to carry them</i>

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:43.480 line:100%
<i>Eighteen bodies, 18 heads</i>

00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:09.440 line:100%
Everything kept here
is evidence of your murders

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:11.680 line:100%
that Uncle Ran collected back then.

00:16:12.560 --> 00:16:15.280 line:100%
Do I need to take it out
and confront you with it piece by piece?

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:39.560 line:100%
Is it beautiful?

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:57.040 line:100%
I killed

00:16:58.280 --> 00:16:59.280 line:100%
Xu Meng and her father.

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:03.320 line:100%
Wu Shanlong was my accomplice.

00:17:04.639 --> 00:17:07.200 line:100%
We conspired to kill Xu Meng
and her father.

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:10.440 line:100%
Xu Meng's body was handled by Wu Shanlong.

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:16.520 line:100%
As for Xu Zhihong's body,

00:17:17.440 --> 00:17:18.840 line:100%
I dismembered it at home.

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:26.040 line:100%
I put the body parts into different bags,

00:17:26.800 --> 00:17:28.600 line:100%
took them to the garage in batches,

00:17:30.680 --> 00:17:33.680 line:100%
transported them out from there,
and dumped them.

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:37.240 line:100%
<i>In the end, I accidentally left</i>
<i>an electrician's bag behind,</i>

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:39.680 line:100%
<i>which was picked up by Qian Dajun.</i>

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:48.000 line:100%
That's the whole truth.

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:50.800 line:100%
Officer He,

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:53.280 line:100%
well done.

00:17:55.520 --> 00:17:59.120 line:100%
Ran always hoped
you would become a police officer,

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:03.200 line:100%
an excellent criminal investigator.

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:06.160 line:100%
Looking at you now,

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:10.840 line:100%
you've already achieved it.

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:15.440 line:100%
I'm sure his soul in heaven

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.960 line:100%
will also feel comforted.

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:24.800 line:100%
Qiao Suqing,

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:28.160 line:100%
you're not worthy of mentioning Uncle Ran.

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:40.240 line:100%
You've confessed to the murder
of Xu Meng and her father.

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:43.800 line:100%
Now, let's talk about
your other murder charge.

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:49.680 line:100%
Who else did I kill?

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:51.280 line:100%
It couldn't be Yao Baiyuan, could it?

00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:53.680 line:100%
His death was an accident.

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:55.800 line:100%
It had nothing to do with me.

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:10.640 line:100%
Xiaohe, a Chinese New Year's gift.

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:13.520 line:100%
The same style! Thank you, Ms. Qiao.

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:21.840 line:100%
Xiaohe, I am a murderer,

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:24.240 line:100%
and I've lied to you for all these years,

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:26.440 line:100%
but I had my reasons.

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:30.160 line:100%
There's no deep-seated hatred
between us, right?

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:31.200 line:100%
Is it necessary for you to cut up

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:33.280 line:100%
-the things I gave you like this?
-Qiao!

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:37.920 line:100%
You were the one who killed Uncle Ran.

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:42.320 line:100%
Are you crazy, He Xiaohe?

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:45.680 line:100%
Ran died in an accident.

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:48.520 line:100%
Don't you go making
baseless accusations here!

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:53.320 line:100%
Just as I thought, you won't confess
until you see the evidence.

00:20:06.360 --> 00:20:09.920 line:100%
JIANGDONG MID ROAD

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:31.160 line:100%
This is road surveillance from the night
of Chinese New Year's Eve 2003.

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:35.080 line:100%
This location is less than two kilometers
from where Uncle Ran had his accident.

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:38.000 line:100%
It was also the only path back to the city
after you finished your part-time job.

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:41.080 line:100%
Tell me,

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.040 line:100%
why did you appear here?

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:45.640 line:100%
That's not me.

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:48.680 line:100%
-That's not me!
-Qiao Suqing, you still want to deny it?

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:51.640 line:100%
When you went to my house that night,
you were dressed just like this.

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:54.120 line:100%
No.

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:55.360 line:100%
No.

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:58.040 line:100%
After I finished my part-time job,
I left directly by taxi.

00:20:58.720 --> 00:21:01.440 line:100%
I… I never went to this place.

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:03.960 line:100%
Qiao,

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:05.840 line:100%
tell me,

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:08.200 line:100%
who else would be wearing the exact same
clothes as you on Chinese New Year's Eve,

00:21:08.280 --> 00:21:09.320 line:100%
braving the rain,

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:10.720 line:100%
and running alone
to the vicinity of the crime scene?

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:13.720 line:100%
Who else, if it wasn't you?

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:16.280 line:100%
It wasn't me.

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:19.160 line:100%
Explain this.

00:21:19.240 --> 00:21:20.880 line:100%
Yao Baiyuan fell to his death.

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:22.400 line:100%
Wu Shanlong fell to his death.

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:23.680 line:100%
Uncle Ran had a car accident.

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:26.560 line:100%
There was construction at every scene,
and there was grease at every scene.

00:21:27.600 --> 00:21:28.920 line:100%
How do you explain that?

00:21:31.360 --> 00:21:33.560 line:100%
Did you set the traps in advance

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:37.920 line:100%
to make it look like
they died in accidents?

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:40.880 line:100%
Wu Shanlong was. Yao Baiyuan wasn't.

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:43.320 line:100%
Yao Baiyuan…

00:21:47.760 --> 00:21:48.880 line:100%
Ran…

00:21:57.160 --> 00:21:58.120 line:100%
Liar.

00:21:58.200 --> 00:21:59.840 line:100%
Liar!

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:01.800 line:100%
I can't believe you lied to me.

00:22:04.600 --> 00:22:05.920 line:100%
What do you mean?

00:22:10.200 --> 00:22:11.560 line:100%
It was her.

00:22:13.880 --> 00:22:15.120 line:100%
It was her.

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:18.160 line:100%
She was the one who killed Ran.

00:22:25.240 --> 00:22:26.200 line:100%
Who?

00:22:27.320 --> 00:22:28.960 line:100%
Who killed Uncle Ran?

00:22:38.440 --> 00:22:39.280 line:100%
Xu Meng.

00:22:41.280 --> 00:22:42.400 line:100%
It was Xu Meng.

00:22:44.240 --> 00:22:45.720 line:100%
Xu Meng didn't die.

00:22:48.560 --> 00:22:50.240 line:100%
She's been alive all along.

00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:24.800 line:100%
Are you Ms. Qiao?

00:24:37.080 --> 00:24:38.720 line:100%
We're from
the Weiyang Public Security Bureau.

00:24:38.800 --> 00:24:40.000 line:100%
Xu Meng,

00:24:40.080 --> 00:24:41.560 line:100%
you are a suspect in a willful homicide.

00:24:41.640 --> 00:24:43.120 line:100%
In accordance with Article 80
of the Criminal Procedure Law,

00:24:44.280 --> 00:24:46.360 line:100%
you are now under lawful detention.

00:24:46.440 --> 00:24:47.880 line:100%
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU
NANSHAN BRANCH: DETENTION WARRANT

00:25:08.760 --> 00:25:10.800 line:100%
INTERROGATION ROOM RULES AND REGULATIONS

00:25:12.880 --> 00:25:14.200 line:100%
Was she caught?

00:26:11.040 --> 00:26:12.320 line:100%
Qiao Suqing,

00:26:13.600 --> 00:26:14.920 line:100%
now that it's come to this,

00:26:15.440 --> 00:26:17.200 line:100%
can you tell the truth?

00:26:20.040 --> 00:26:21.120 line:100%
Xu Meng and I

00:26:23.240 --> 00:26:25.560 line:100%
met through pen pal correspondence

00:26:26.840 --> 00:26:28.440 line:100%
in the spring of 1995.

00:26:30.040 --> 00:26:32.600 line:100%
The two of us share the same birth date.

00:26:33.200 --> 00:26:36.840 line:100%
At the time, we were listed together
in a pen pal column in a magazine.

00:26:38.480 --> 00:26:40.640 line:100%
She said her mother's surname
was also Qiao.

00:26:41.640 --> 00:26:43.920 line:100%
She was born two hours later than I,

00:26:45.560 --> 00:26:47.000 line:100%
so she called me "sister".

00:26:48.480 --> 00:26:50.880 line:100%
Our family situations
were very similar as well.

00:26:52.440 --> 00:26:53.720 line:100%
She didn't have a mother,

00:26:54.720 --> 00:26:56.080 line:100%
and I didn't have a father.

00:26:57.800 --> 00:27:00.560 line:100%
We both wanted to build
a complete family again.

00:27:07.040 --> 00:27:08.000 line:100%
Qing.

00:27:08.080 --> 00:27:09.080 line:100%
-Yes?
-Want an ice pop?

00:27:09.160 --> 00:27:10.840 line:100%
No, thanks. You have it, Mom.

00:27:10.920 --> 00:27:12.840 line:100%
<i>YOUTH DIGEST</i>

00:27:12.920 --> 00:27:14.320 line:100%
<i>In August that year,</i>

00:27:15.520 --> 00:27:17.200 line:100%
<i>we made a plan</i>

00:27:17.280 --> 00:27:19.640 line:100%
<i>to join a tour group to Mount Wu together.</i>

00:27:20.800 --> 00:27:22.760 line:100%
KUNPENG TRAVEL AGENCY

00:27:24.400 --> 00:27:26.600 line:100%
<i>It wasn't just</i>
<i>so the two of us could meet.</i>

00:27:27.720 --> 00:27:30.000 line:100%
<i>It was also actually</i>
<i>to set our parents up.</i>

00:27:30.080 --> 00:27:31.520 line:100%
PEN PAL MATCH: NIHAI PIANXIAN

00:27:32.120 --> 00:27:33.240 line:100%
<i>If it worked out,</i>

00:27:33.800 --> 00:27:36.040 line:100%
<i>we could become a family</i>

00:27:38.880 --> 00:27:40.840 line:100%
<i>and become real sisters.</i>

00:27:41.480 --> 00:27:42.320 line:100%
-Very nice.
-Okay.

00:27:46.880 --> 00:27:49.200 line:100%
Okay. Let's do a roll call.

00:27:49.280 --> 00:27:51.040 line:100%
-Wang Zusheng?
-Here.

00:27:52.040 --> 00:27:54.000 line:100%
-Qiao Suqing?
-Here.

00:27:56.040 --> 00:27:57.480 line:100%
-Fang Xiuhong?
-Present.

00:27:58.120 --> 00:28:00.520 line:100%
-Xu Zhihong?
-Right here.

00:28:01.040 --> 00:28:03.440 line:100%
-Xu Meng?
-Here too.

00:28:07.280 --> 00:28:09.480 line:100%
Everyone, stay close. Watch your step.

00:28:10.520 --> 00:28:11.560 line:100%
Everyone,

00:28:11.640 --> 00:28:13.160 line:100%
right beneath our feet

00:28:13.240 --> 00:28:15.560 line:100%
-It flied away!
-is the famous Mount Wu Slot.

00:28:15.640 --> 00:28:18.360 line:100%
Now, remember when walking
on the suspension bridge,

00:28:18.440 --> 00:28:20.680 line:100%
no running or jumping. Stay safe.

00:28:20.760 --> 00:28:21.840 line:100%
Those in the back, please keep up.

00:28:31.080 --> 00:28:32.040 line:100%
Here.

00:28:33.160 --> 00:28:34.360 line:100%
Wear mine.

00:28:37.200 --> 00:28:39.680 line:100%
Alright, everyone.
We're about to head up the mountain.

00:28:39.760 --> 00:28:41.480 line:100%
Watch your step and stay safe.

00:28:51.640 --> 00:28:53.960 line:100%
Everyone, we must be careful
with our footing.

00:28:54.040 --> 00:28:55.760 line:100%
The path is a bit slippery today.

00:28:59.760 --> 00:29:00.840 line:100%
What's wrong?

00:29:00.920 --> 00:29:02.800 line:100%
-Are you okay?
-Why is the fog so thick?

00:29:02.880 --> 00:29:05.120 line:100%
-I can't even see the road.
-Everyone, don't panic.

00:29:05.720 --> 00:29:07.960 line:100%
This kind of weather
is very common on Mount Wu.

00:29:08.040 --> 00:29:09.040 line:100%
How about this?

00:29:09.120 --> 00:29:10.920 line:100%
Let us all hold hands.

00:29:13.280 --> 00:29:15.160 line:100%
Sister, don't be afraid.

00:29:15.240 --> 00:29:16.080 line:100%
I'm right here with you.

00:29:21.000 --> 00:29:22.080 line:100%
Steady now.

00:29:22.720 --> 00:29:23.640 line:100%
Mom…

00:29:24.400 --> 00:29:26.160 line:100%
I'm having a hard time breathing.

00:29:26.240 --> 00:29:27.240 line:100%
Come and rest here for a bit.

00:29:27.840 --> 00:29:28.880 line:100%
Sit down.

00:29:32.240 --> 00:29:34.320 line:100%
Hey, we really can't stay here.

00:29:34.400 --> 00:29:36.120 line:100%
Once it gets dark, it'll be freezing cold.

00:29:36.200 --> 00:29:38.160 line:100%
What's wrong with waiting a moment?

00:29:38.240 --> 00:29:39.560 line:100%
Can't you be a little considerate?

00:29:39.640 --> 00:29:41.320 line:100%
If you want to die,
don't drag us down with you.

00:29:41.400 --> 00:29:43.360 line:100%
Why do you care about her?
Let's just get moving.

00:29:43.440 --> 00:29:44.480 line:100%
Fine. You guys rest for a while,

00:29:44.560 --> 00:29:46.240 line:100%
-but catch up quickly.
-Hurry up.

00:29:48.440 --> 00:29:49.360 line:100%
-<i>I was unconscious then.</i>
-Qing!

00:29:50.880 --> 00:29:53.520 line:100%
As for what happened later,
I have no idea.

00:29:55.320 --> 00:29:56.560 line:100%
When I woke up,

00:29:57.080 --> 00:29:58.840 line:100%
Xu Meng and her father were gone.

00:30:00.200 --> 00:30:02.000 line:100%
I was completely dazed.

00:30:02.760 --> 00:30:05.520 line:100%
I thought my mom
had accidentally fallen off the cliff.

00:30:07.040 --> 00:30:09.040 line:100%
It felt like in the blink of an eye…

00:30:10.840 --> 00:30:12.000 line:100%
Mom was gone.

00:30:13.480 --> 00:30:14.720 line:100%
My home was gone.

00:30:17.120 --> 00:30:18.520 line:100%
Everything was gone.

00:30:25.040 --> 00:30:28.120 line:100%
When did you run into Xu Meng again?

00:30:28.840 --> 00:30:30.440 line:100%
About half a year later.

00:30:32.080 --> 00:30:33.840 line:100%
When I came to Weiyang back then,

00:30:36.160 --> 00:30:37.840 line:100%
I stayed at Yao Baiyuan's place.

00:31:09.440 --> 00:31:10.720 line:100%
<i>That night,</i>

00:31:11.760 --> 00:31:13.440 line:100%
<i>we talked a lot.</i>

00:31:14.480 --> 00:31:15.760 line:100%
<i>That's when I learned</i>

00:31:16.960 --> 00:31:18.760 line:100%
<i>that after returning from Mount Wu,</i>

00:31:19.640 --> 00:31:21.040 line:100%
<i>her life</i>

00:31:21.920 --> 00:31:24.040 line:100%
<i>wasn't much better than mine.</i>

00:31:25.920 --> 00:31:29.320 line:100%
PEACE AND LUCK TO ALL
WEALTH AND JOY TO HOME

00:31:30.520 --> 00:31:31.840 line:100%
Where's the medicine? Medicine!

00:31:32.360 --> 00:31:33.400 line:100%
Where did you hide the medicine?

00:31:36.160 --> 00:31:37.200 line:100%
Where did you put the medicine?

00:31:39.080 --> 00:31:41.480 line:100%
Medicine! Medicine! Where's the medicine?

00:31:42.720 --> 00:31:45.600 line:100%
It's all your fault
that I've ended up like this!

00:31:46.200 --> 00:31:48.480 line:100%
I need my medicine!

00:31:49.160 --> 00:31:50.160 line:100%
You!

00:31:51.200 --> 00:31:52.720 line:100%
-Dad, please stop hitting me!
-Get me my medicine!

00:31:52.800 --> 00:31:53.960 line:100%
I was wrong, Dad!

00:31:54.560 --> 00:31:55.560 line:100%
-Dad, please stop!
-I need my medicine!

00:31:55.640 --> 00:31:56.880 line:100%
I was wrong, Dad!

00:31:56.960 --> 00:31:58.240 line:100%
-Dad!
-Where is my medine?

00:31:58.760 --> 00:32:03.240 line:100%
QIHUANG CLINIC

00:32:06.880 --> 00:32:08.280 line:100%
Master Zhang,

00:32:09.080 --> 00:32:11.160 line:100%
I'm here for the medicine. Master Zhang?

00:32:15.720 --> 00:32:16.960 line:100%
Master Zhang.

00:32:20.360 --> 00:32:22.160 line:100%
CARE AND VIRTUE, A HEALER'S HEART

00:32:37.360 --> 00:32:38.760 line:100%
<i>Back then,</i>

00:32:40.080 --> 00:32:44.320 line:100%
<i>we were like two elk caught in a snare.</i>

00:32:44.400 --> 00:32:46.720 line:100%
<i>Neither of us could escape,</i>

00:32:46.800 --> 00:32:48.040 line:100%
<i>and neither could help the other.</i>

00:32:49.040 --> 00:32:51.200 line:100%
<i>All we could do</i>
<i>was watch each other in silence.</i>

00:32:53.560 --> 00:32:55.000 line:100%
Six months later,

00:32:56.600 --> 00:32:58.360 line:100%
I managed to escape first.

00:33:10.320 --> 00:33:11.240 line:100%
Sister.

00:33:19.200 --> 00:33:20.040 line:20%
A Chinese New Year's gift.

00:33:24.080 --> 00:33:25.480 line:100%
Take a look.

00:33:27.720 --> 00:33:28.920 line:100%
It's beautiful.

00:33:30.600 --> 00:33:31.440 line:100%
It must have been expensive.

00:33:32.080 --> 00:33:34.600 line:100%
It didn't cost anything.
Mr. Yao gave it to me.

00:33:39.360 --> 00:33:41.280 line:100%
Happy Chinese New Year, Sister.

00:33:55.840 --> 00:33:56.720 line:100%
He hit you again?

00:33:59.680 --> 00:34:02.640 line:100%
Do you like this gift?

00:34:10.439 --> 00:34:11.280 line:100%
I do.

00:34:29.360 --> 00:34:30.720 line:100%
Happy Chinese New Year,

00:34:31.240 --> 00:34:32.240 line:100%
Sister.

00:34:36.120 --> 00:34:37.640 line:100%
Happy Chinese New Year.

00:35:39.160 --> 00:35:40.800 line:100%
Sister, what's wrong?

00:35:42.200 --> 00:35:43.800 line:100%
Yao is finally gone.

00:35:43.880 --> 00:35:45.800 line:100%
Is there still something
making you unhappy?

00:35:47.080 --> 00:35:48.320 line:100%
I was thinking,

00:35:50.280 --> 00:35:51.440 line:100%
what's going to happen to you?

00:35:53.240 --> 00:35:55.680 line:100%
When will you be able
to get away from the guy?

00:35:57.600 --> 00:36:01.880 line:100%
Meng, why don't you move into my place?

00:36:04.680 --> 00:36:06.800 line:100%
Don't go back to that house anymore.

00:36:10.400 --> 00:36:12.040 line:100%
He's my father.

00:36:12.680 --> 00:36:14.400 line:100%
I've owed him since the day I was born.

00:36:25.040 --> 00:36:28.880 line:100%
I'm not as lucky as you.

00:36:30.880 --> 00:36:32.480 line:100%
An "accident" like that

00:36:35.400 --> 00:36:37.400 line:100%
doesn't happen that easily.

00:36:46.600 --> 00:36:48.320 line:100%
So you didn't know

00:36:48.960 --> 00:36:52.320 line:100%
that Yao Baiyuan
might have been killed by Xu Meng?

00:36:53.200 --> 00:36:55.960 line:100%
At the time, I really thought
it was an accident.

00:36:56.600 --> 00:36:58.600 line:100%
Then, how did Xu Zhihong die?

00:37:01.720 --> 00:37:05.640 line:100%
Xu Meng said it was all for me.

00:37:15.000 --> 00:37:17.320 line:100%
Dad, what are you doing?

00:37:17.400 --> 00:37:19.280 line:100%
Close the door. Hurry up!

00:37:19.360 --> 00:37:20.440 line:100%
Close it!

00:37:24.040 --> 00:37:26.240 line:100%
Leave Weiyang. Pack your things right now.

00:37:26.320 --> 00:37:28.520 line:100%
-We're leaving now.
-But Dad,

00:37:28.600 --> 00:37:30.720 line:100%
why do we have to leave Weiyang?

00:37:30.800 --> 00:37:32.960 line:100%
You ask why? I'll tell you why!

00:37:33.040 --> 00:37:37.280 line:100%
Behind my back,
you took out so many shark loans.

00:37:37.360 --> 00:37:39.240 line:100%
Those people are already at our doorstep.

00:37:39.880 --> 00:37:43.080 line:100%
If we don't leave,
we're just staying here to die?

00:37:44.160 --> 00:37:46.360 line:100%
I'll find a way to pay them back.

00:37:46.880 --> 00:37:47.880 line:100%
Can we please not leave?

00:37:48.480 --> 00:37:49.400 line:100%
Pay them with what?

00:37:49.920 --> 00:37:51.320 line:100%
By selling yourself?

00:37:51.400 --> 00:37:54.440 line:100%
That's enough. Go pack your clothes! Move!

00:37:54.520 --> 00:37:56.520 line:100%
-Go!
-Dad, don't force me.

00:37:56.600 --> 00:37:58.400 line:100%
You won't leave, and I'm "forcing" you?

00:37:58.480 --> 00:38:00.000 line:100%
Is it because of the wretch?

00:38:01.520 --> 00:38:03.880 line:100%
You ungrateful brat!

00:38:04.480 --> 00:38:06.680 line:100%
I'm the one who gave you life.

00:38:07.320 --> 00:38:09.480 line:100%
Go. You're coming with me.

00:38:10.720 --> 00:38:11.960 line:100%
Dad, don't touch that.

00:38:12.760 --> 00:38:15.240 line:100%
Did the wretch give you this outfit?

00:38:16.360 --> 00:38:17.400 line:100%
Dad, don't.

00:38:17.480 --> 00:38:18.480 line:100%
Let go of me.

00:38:18.560 --> 00:38:20.160 line:100%
Let go. Let go!

00:38:20.760 --> 00:38:21.760 line:100%
You won't come with me?

00:38:22.360 --> 00:38:24.240 line:100%
-Are you coming?
-Dad, don't force me.

00:38:25.120 --> 00:38:26.080 line:100%
I'm forcing you?

00:38:26.160 --> 00:38:28.440 line:100%
I'm forcing you?

00:38:28.520 --> 00:38:30.320 line:100%
You don't want to leave?

00:38:30.400 --> 00:38:33.320 line:100%
That's fine. I'll go find
the wretch right now

00:38:33.400 --> 00:38:34.960 line:100%
and beat her to death!

00:38:35.480 --> 00:38:37.200 line:100%
Now, are you coming?

00:38:57.720 --> 00:39:00.280 line:100%
The wretch…

00:39:00.360 --> 00:39:03.280 line:100%
If it weren't for her back then,

00:39:03.360 --> 00:39:08.040 line:100%
I wouldn't have ended up like this.

00:39:08.120 --> 00:39:10.080 line:100%
I'm going to kill her.

00:39:10.680 --> 00:39:12.520 line:100%
I'll kill her…

00:39:15.520 --> 00:39:16.640 line:100%
Medicine…

00:39:16.720 --> 00:39:18.440 line:100%
Medicine… Give it to me.

00:39:18.520 --> 00:39:19.760 line:100%
Medicine…

00:39:21.400 --> 00:39:22.480 line:100%
My medicine.

00:39:23.720 --> 00:39:24.640 line:100%
Quick.

00:39:25.360 --> 00:39:27.760 line:100%
Hurry… Get me my medicine.

00:39:46.520 --> 00:39:48.480 line:20%
PENICILLIN V TABLETS

00:39:55.160 --> 00:39:56.480 line:100%
What happened?

00:40:34.440 --> 00:40:35.480 line:100%
Sister,

00:40:36.400 --> 00:40:39.840 line:100%
when your mom fell off the cliff,
it wasn't an accident.

00:40:41.840 --> 00:40:43.560 line:100%
He was the one who pushed her.

00:40:53.240 --> 00:40:55.720 line:100%
Qing. Qing. Qing, what's wrong?

00:40:55.800 --> 00:40:56.840 line:100%
-Sister.
-Qing.

00:40:56.920 --> 00:40:58.200 line:100%
-<i>You fainted from the cold.</i>
-Sister,

00:40:58.280 --> 00:41:00.160 line:100%
-<i>He tried to take your coat for warmth.</i>
-wake up.

00:41:01.160 --> 00:41:02.600 line:100%
-Qing.
-Sister…

00:41:04.720 --> 00:41:05.800 line:100%
What are you doing?

00:41:06.480 --> 00:41:07.880 line:100%
She's not going to make it anyway.

00:41:07.960 --> 00:41:09.880 line:100%
This coat should be given
to someone who can survive.

00:41:09.960 --> 00:41:11.720 line:100%
What are you talking about?

00:41:11.800 --> 00:41:13.280 line:100%
-Stop it.
-Let go.

00:41:13.360 --> 00:41:14.800 line:100%
-Stop fighting.
-Stay out of this.

00:41:14.880 --> 00:41:18.320 line:100%
<i>Your mom tried to stop him,</i>
<i>so he started wrestling with her.</i>

00:41:19.080 --> 00:41:20.040 line:100%
Dad.

00:41:20.560 --> 00:41:21.520 line:100%
Dad.

00:41:23.840 --> 00:41:24.720 line:100%
Dad.

00:41:25.720 --> 00:41:26.920 line:100%
Dad.

00:41:27.760 --> 00:41:29.120 line:100%
Dad…

00:41:29.200 --> 00:41:32.320 line:100%
Help. Is anyone there? Help.

00:41:32.400 --> 00:41:34.720 line:100%
Help. Is anyone there?

00:41:34.800 --> 00:41:36.360 line:100%
Help.

00:42:04.160 --> 00:42:06.480 line:100%
<i>He thinks his illness is all our fault.</i>

00:42:07.200 --> 00:42:08.840 line:100%
<i>He tortures me every day,</i>

00:42:08.920 --> 00:42:10.520 line:100%
<i>and now he wants to come after you.</i>

00:42:11.200 --> 00:42:12.560 line:100%
<i>I had no other choice.</i>

00:42:22.560 --> 00:42:24.880 line:100%
PEACE AND LUCK TO ALL
WEALTH AND JOY TO HOME

00:42:49.440 --> 00:42:50.400 line:100%
Sister,

00:42:52.400 --> 00:42:54.880 line:100%
from now on, we are real sisters.

00:42:57.120 --> 00:42:59.040 line:100%
I will protect you with my life.

00:43:21.560 --> 00:43:25.960 line:100%
Xu, inside your place,
why is there all that banging?

00:43:26.040 --> 00:43:27.440 line:100%
Is everything all right?

00:43:27.520 --> 00:43:29.880 line:100%
My dad wanted to sell the large wardrobe.

00:43:29.960 --> 00:43:32.680 line:100%
The door is too narrow,
so we couldn't get it out.

00:43:33.800 --> 00:43:36.160 line:100%
So I'm trying to chip at the door frame.

00:43:39.520 --> 00:43:42.680 line:100%
By the way, Uncle Wang, do you have…

00:43:42.760 --> 00:43:44.840 line:100%
Oh, I've got mung bean soup on the stove.

00:43:44.920 --> 00:43:46.520 line:100%
It's about to burn.

00:43:47.200 --> 00:43:48.440 line:100%
It's burning.

00:44:09.040 --> 00:44:10.080 line:100%
Take this

00:44:11.400 --> 00:44:12.760 line:100%
back to my house.

00:44:16.720 --> 00:44:18.080 line:100%
I'll protect you, too.